---
const TRUST_BADGES = [
  { title: 'Installed by pros', description: 'Certified technicians install and configure every tracker.' },
  { title: 'Proactive maintenance', description: 'We schedule the work before something breaks, not after.' },
  { title: 'One call fixes it', description: 'One number, one team, one invoice — no vendor maze.' },
];
---
<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="kicker">Trusted by the best</span>
    <h2>Proven on the ground, not just on a screen.</h2>
    <p class="lead" style="margin-top:18px;max-width:720px;">
      The same data loggers powering fleets at Volkswagen, Cummins, and Thermo King — installed, configured, and warranted by SafePrevent. You never touch J1939 filters, DBC files, or SIMs. We bring the AI and the technical expertise; you get one invoice, one number to call, and zero breakdowns.
    </p>
    <div style="display:flex;gap:32px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:32px;">
      {TRUST_BADGES.map((badge) => (
        <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:12px;opacity:0.9;">
          <img src={`/trust-logos/${badge.logo}.svg`} alt={badge.alt} style="height:48px;width:auto;" />
          <span style="font-size:0.95rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--white);">{badge.name}</span>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
    <p class="muted" style="margin-top:24px;max-width:640px;">
      Not just proven on a screen — proven on the ground. We install the hardware, configure the data pipeline, and stand behind it with a 3-year warranty. One call, one number to call, one team that shows up.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>